| Function | Edge Cases |
|---|---|
| `initialize` | Supabase `getUser` returns error (`set({isLoading: false})` and returns); User is null (skips fetchProfile/fetchMachines); User is present (chained calls); `fetchProfile` or `fetchMachines` throws |
| `fetchProfile` | `user` is null (early return); Supabase returns null data (no-op); Profile data shape mismatch |
| `fetchMachines` | `profile.site_id` is null/undefined (early return); Supabase returns empty array; `cacheMachines` throws; `data` is null |
| `signOut` | Clears only user/profile/machines/todayReports — does NOT reset `pendingReports`, `pendingCount`, `isOffline`, `isLoading` |
| State selectors | Per-subscriber selectors (`useStore(s => s.machines)`) cause re-renders when unrelated slices update |

`★ Insight ─────────────────────────────────────`
`signOut` resets only 4 of 8 state fields. After sign-out, `pendingCount` and `isOffline` retain their previous values. A component subscribing to `pendingCount` could briefly show stale data before the next sync cycle overwrites it. This is a subtle state-reset bug that only surfaces in testing.
`─────────────────────────────────────────────────`

**Test skeleton — `src/store/__tests__/store.test.ts`:**

```typescript
jest.mock('../../lib/supabase', () => ({
  supabase: { auth: { getUser: jest.fn(), signOut: jest.fn() } },
}));

import { useStore } from '../index';

describe('store state management', () => {
  beforeEach(() => useStore.setState(useStore.getInitialState()));

  describe('initialize', () => {
    it('sets isLoading=false when getUser fails', async () => { });
    it('chains fetchProfile and fetchMachines when user exists', async () => { });
    it('calls refreshPendingCount regardless of auth state', async () => { });
  });

  describe('fetchProfile', () => {
    it('early-returns when user is null', async () => { });
    it('sets profile when data is returned', async () => { });
  });

  describe('fetchMachines', () => {
    it('early-returns when profile.site_id is missing', async () => { });
    it('calls db.cacheMachines with mapped data', async () => { });
  });

  describe('signOut', () => {
    it('resets user, profile, machines, todayReports', async () => { });
    it('does NOT reset pendingCount, isOffline, isLoading', async () => { });
  });
});
```

